[{"answer":"Hello?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi. It's Laura Cariton here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/2.mp3"},{"answer":"We've just arrived at the holiday flat, but I can't get the hot water and heating to work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/4.mp3"},{"answer":"That's easy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't worry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/6.mp3"},{"answer":"In the upstairs cupboard, you'll find the water heater.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/7.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll see three main controls on the left at the bottom of the heater.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/8.mp3"},{"answer":"The first one - the round one on the far left -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/9.mp3"},{"answer":"is the most important one for the heating and hot water.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/10.mp3"},{"answer":"It's the main control switch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Make sure it's in the 'on' position.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/12.mp3"},{"answer":"The switch itself doesn't light up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/13.mp3"},{"answer":"But the little square below will be black if the switch is 'off'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/14.mp3"},{"answer":"That's probably what's happened - it's got switched off by mistake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/15.mp3"},{"answer":"The middle one of these three controls - you'll see it's slightly larger than the first one - controls the radiators.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/16.mp3"},{"answer":"If you feel cold while you're there and need the radiators on,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/17.mp3"},{"answer":"this needs to be turned to maximum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/18.mp3"},{"answer":"The last of the three controls - the one on the right -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/19.mp3"},{"answer":"is usually on about a number four setting which, for the water in the taps, is usually quite hot enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Below the heating controls in the middle is a small round plastic button.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/21.mp3"},{"answer":"If there isn't enough water in the pipes, sometimes the heater goes out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/22.mp3"},{"answer":"If this happens you'll need to press this button to reset the heater.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Hold it in for about five seconds","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and the heater should come on again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there's a little square indicator under the third knob that's a kind of alarm light.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/26.mp3"},{"answer":"It'll flash if you need to reset the heater.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/27.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds complicated...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure you won't have any problems with it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/29.mp3"},{"answer":"There should be some more instructions on the side of the heater.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Call me back if you can't make it work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/32.mp3"},{"answer":"While you're on the phone, we haven't managed to find a few things we need,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/33.mp3"},{"answer":"like extra pillows for the beds and some washing powder.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there any here?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Pillows... yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/36.mp3"},{"answer":"If you look in the cupboard,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/37.mp3"},{"answer":"the large white one upstairs - to the left of the bathroom door -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/38.mp3"},{"answer":"there should be four or five on the top shelf.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/39.mp3"},{"answer":"And if you want to do some washing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/40.mp3"},{"answer":"there's some powder for that...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/41.mp3"},{"answer":"probably by the back door.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/42.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a kind of shelf there above the sink.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/43.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, I'm sure there's some there, in a large blue box.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/44.mp3"},{"answer":"You need about half a cup full for each wash.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... and that reminds me,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/46.mp3"},{"answer":"the spare key to the back door is hanging on a hook on the wall by the sitting room window.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Please make sure to put it back when you've used it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/48.mp3"},{"answer":"The previous guests lost it in the garden and I had to get another one made.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/49.mp3"},{"answer":"And, if you have any trouble with the lamps.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/50.mp3"},{"answer":"you'll find some spare bulbs in a large cardboard box.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/51.mp3"},{"answer":"It's on top of the washing machine with all kinds of useful things in it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and another thing I forgot to mention when we last spoke...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I've left you a local map, so you'll be able to find your way around easily.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/55.mp3"},{"answer":"It shows the whole area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I put it in the top drawer of the chest under the TV in your bedroom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/57.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a whole file of local information in there too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/59.mp3"},{"answer":"What about visiting the town?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you give us any advice?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/62.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll need to take the car.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/63.mp3"},{"answer":"It's too far to walk from the flat really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/64.mp3"},{"answer":"You have to pay to leave your car in all the car parks now I'm afraid...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/65.mp3"},{"answer":"I like the one that's by the station best","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/66.mp3"},{"answer":"and you can walk to the town centre from there in five minutes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/67.mp3"},{"answer":"That's where all the best restaurants are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/68.mp3"},{"answer":"But if you want a takeaway,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/69.mp3"},{"answer":"the Italian one does really good pasta and pizzas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Call 732281 for that one,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/71.mp3"},{"answer":"or 766119 for the Chinese.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/72.mp3"},{"answer":"They're both good and they'll both deliver to the flat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/73.mp3"},{"answer":"As for places to visit,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/74.mp3"},{"answer":"yes, do go and see the railway museum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/75.mp3"},{"answer":"The exhibition is small but really good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/76.mp3"},{"answer":"It gets very crowded on Sundays,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/77.mp3"},{"answer":"so I suggest you visit it on a quieter day, later in the week,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/78.mp3"},{"answer":"but not on Thursdays which is market day -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/79.mp3"},{"answer":"you won't find anywhere to park","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/80.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's also the only day of the week when they're not open!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Not for the moment. Thanks!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-2-2023-07-24-14-49-19/83.mp3"}]
